{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a full-screen "destination hero slider" block. Build an exact static layout first.
    
    OVERALL
    - Full-bleed: width 100vw (break out of any page-width container with margin-left: calc(50% - 50vw)), height 100svh, min-height 640px, position relative, overflow hidden, background #111.
    - Scope all markup, CSS and JS to a wrapper with a unique id based on block.id, so multiple instances never clash. Use plain CSS and vanilla JS only, no libraries.
    - Accent colour setting (default #ECAB32). All text is white.
    
    LAYER 1 — BACKGROUND
    - The active slide's image covers the whole block (object-fit: cover).
    - Three overlays on top of it: (a) flat black at the "overlay opacity" setting (default 25%); (b) a left-to-right gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.40) to transparent at 55%, for text legibility; (c) a top gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.35) to transparent at 20%, so a transparent theme header stays readable.
    
    LAYER 2 — TOP AUTOPLAY BAR
    - A 3px bar pinned to the very top edge. The track is transparent and the fill uses the accent colour. Start the fill at 0% width (Part 2 animates it).
    
    LAYER 3 — LEFT CONTENT (active slide)
    Left padding 5vw. Absolutely positioned: the top sits at 35% of the section height, and the bottom of the button row lines up with the bottom edge of the cards (about 82% of the height). Stack, in order:
    1. A white dash, 20px × 3px, with 18px space below.
    2. The location eyebrow (e.g. "Switzerland Alps"): body font, clamp(15px, 1.4vw, 22px), weight 300, inside an overflow:hidden mask, with 14px space below.
    3. A two-line title. Put each line in its own span inside its own overflow:hidden mask (Part 2 needs this). Use the display font, UPPERCASE, tall condensed bold (default Oswald 700, font_picker handle oswald_n7), font-size clamp(52px, 7.2vw, 112px), line-height 1.02.
    4. A description: 14px, line-height 1.75, white at 75% opacity, max-width 390px, margin 18px 0 28px.
    5. A button row, gap 16px, vertically centred:
       - Bookmark: a 38px circle filled with the accent colour, holding a white 14px bookmark SVG. Clicking it toggles a "saved" state (icon filled or outlined), client-side only.
       - A "DISCOVER LOCATION" pill: 40px tall, padding 0 28px, transparent, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), radius 999px, 11px uppercase, letter-spacing .12em, weight 500. On hover: white background, dark text. It links to the slide's button link., LAYER 4 — CARD TRACK (upcoming slides)
    - Positioned left: 41% and top: 42%. It runs off the right edge and the last visible card is cut off by the screen edge. That is intended.
    - Show every slide except the active one, in order after it, looping. Active 1 → cards 2,3,4,5,6. Active 3 → cards 4,5,6,1,2.
    - Each card is a <button>: width clamp(170px, 14.6vw, 240px), aspect-ratio 13/20, gap 1.9vw, border-radius 10px, overflow hidden, box-shadow 0 22px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35). Image object-fit cover. Bottom overlay gradient from rgba(0,0,0,.65) to transparent at 55%.
    - Card text sits bottom-left with padding 0 16px 20px: a 12px × 2px white dash; the location at 12px, white 85%; the title on 2 lines, UPPERCASE display font, 21px, line-height 1.05.
    - On hover: translateY(-6px) and a deeper shadow, over 300ms.
    
    LAYER 5 — CONTROLS ROW
    - Vertical centre at 91% of the height. The left edge lines up with the first card (41%); the right edge is 4vw from the screen edge.
    - Prev and next arrows: 60px circles, 1px border rgba(255,255,255,.55), transparent, thin white chevron SVGs, gap 12px. On hover: white border and background rgba(255,255,255,.1).
    - A progress line fills the space between the arrows and the counter (margin 0 24px): a 1px line in rgba(255,255,255,.35) with a 2px accent fill on top. Fill width = activeIndex ÷ totalSlides, so slide 1 = 0% and slide 2 = 16.7% when there are 6 slides.
    - A counter on the right showing two digits ("01"): display font, clamp(36px, 3.6vw, 56px), inside an overflow:hidden box one line tall.
    
    SETTINGS
    Global: accent colour; display font (font_picker, default oswald_n7); overlay opacity (range 0–80, default 25); autoplay (checkbox, on); autoplay seconds (range 3–12, default 6); pause on hover (checkbox, on).
    Slides: 6 fixed groups with a header for each ("Slide 1" to "Slide 6"). Each group has: image (image_picker), location (text), title line 1 (text), title line 2 (text), description (textarea), button label (text, default "Discover location"), button link (url). Skip any slide without a title, so the block works with 2 to 6 slides. If a slide has no image, use a Shopify placeholder SVG on dark grey., DEMO CONTENT (defaults)
    1. Switzerland Alps — SAINT / ANTÖNIEN
    2. Japan Alps — NAGANO / PREFECTURE
    3. Sahara Desert - Morocco — MARRAKECH / MERZOUGA
    4. Sierra Nevada - United States — YOSEMITE / NATIONAL PARK
    5. Tarifa - Spain — LOS LANCES / BEACH
    6. Cappadocia - Turkey — GÖREME / VALLEY
    Use this description on all six: "Mauris malesuada nisi sit amet augue accumsan tincidunt. Maecenas tincidunt, velit ac porttitor pulvinar, tortor eros facilisis libero."
    
    RESPONSIVE
    - ≤1024px: cards clamp(150px, 18vw, 190px); the track starts at left 46%.
    - ≤749px: content top at 18%; title clamp(40px, 11vw, 56px); description max-width 90%. The card track moves under the content (left 5vw, bottom 120px), cards are 132px wide with a 12px gap, and the row scrolls horizontally with scroll-snap. The controls row sits at bottom 32px with 5vw side padding; arrows are 48px and the counter is 32px.
    
    IMAGES
    Each slide has one image, used for both its background and its card. Use image_url + image_tag with srcset (backgrounds up to 2400w, cards up to 600w). Load slide 1's background eagerly with fetchpriority="high". Lazy-load everything else.
    
    Render slide 1 as active. Prev, next and card clicks only need to swap content for now. 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }}{display:block;position:relative;width:100vw;height:100svh;min-height:640px;margin-left:calc(50% - 50vw);overflow:hidden;background:#111;color:#fff}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-overlay{position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,{{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by:100.0 }});pointer-events:none}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-grad{position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(0,0,0,.4),transparent 55%),linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.35),transparent 20%);pointer-events:none}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-ph{position:absolute;inset:0;background:#333;display:grid;place-items:center}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-ph svg{width:100%;height:100%}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-bar{position:absolute;z-index:4;top:0;width:100%;height:3px;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-copy{position:absolute;z-index:2;top:35%;left:5vw;width:40%;font-family:{{ block.settings.body_font.family }},sans-serif}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-dash{width:20px;height:3px;margin-bottom:18px;background:#fff}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-location{display:block;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:clamp(15px,1.4vw,22px);font-weight:300}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title{margin:0;font:700 clamp(52px,7.2vw,112px)/1.02 {{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title span{display:block;overflow:hidden}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-desc{max-width:390px;margin:18px 0 28px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-save{width:38px;height:38px;border:0;border-radius:50%;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }};color:#fff}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-link{height:40px;padding:0 28px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid #ffffff8c;border-radius:999px;color:#fff;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-decoration:none;text-transform:uppercase}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-link:hover{background:#fff;color:#111}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cards{position:absolute;z-index:2;top:42%;left:41%;display:flex;gap:1.9vw}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card{position:relative;flex:0 0 clamp(170px,14.6vw,240px);aspect-ratio:13/20;overflow:hidden;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:#333;color:#fff;box-shadow:0 22px 40px #0006;transition:transform 300ms,box-shadow 300ms}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);box-shadow:0 28px 48px #0009}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card img,#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card .dh-ph{position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card:after{position:absolute;inset:40% 0 0;content:'';background:linear-gradient(0deg,rgba(0,0,0,.65),transparent 55%)}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cardcopy{position:absolute;z-index:1;bottom:0;left:0;padding:0 16px 20px;text-align:left}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cardcopy:before{content:'';display:block;width:12px;height:2px;background:#fff;margin-bottom:8px}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cardcopy small{display:block;color:#fffd;font:12px sans-serif}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cardcopy strong{font:700 21px/1.05 {{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:91%;left:41%;right:4vw;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;transform:translateY(-50%)}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow{flex:0 0 60px;width:60px;height:60px;border:1px solid #ffffff8c;border-radius:50%;background:transparent;color:#fff;font-size:24px}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow:hover{border-color:#fff;background:#ffffff1a}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress{flex:1;height:1px;margin:0 12px;background:#ffffff59}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress i{display:block;height:2px;background:{{ block.settings.accent_color }}}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-count{width:70px;overflow:hidden;text-align:right;font:700 clamp(36px,3.6vw,56px)/1 {{ block.settings.display_font.family }},sans-serif}@media(max-width:1024px) and (min-width:750px){#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card{flex-basis:clamp(150px,18vw,190px)}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cards{left:46%}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls{left:46%}}@media(max-width:749px){#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-copy{top:18%;left:5vw;width:90%}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-title{font-size:clamp(40px,11vw,56px)}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-desc{max-width:90%}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-cards{top:auto;bottom:120px;left:5vw;right:0;overflow-x:auto;gap:12px;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding:4px 5vw 4px 0}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-card{flex:0 0 132px;scroll-snap-align:start}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-controls{top:auto;bottom:32px;left:5vw;right:5vw;transform:none;gap:10px}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-arrow{flex-basis:48px;width:48px;height:48px}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-count{width:44px;font-size:32px}#dh-{{ ai_gen_id }} .dh-progress{margin:0 8px}}
{% endstyle %}
<destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} id="dh-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-autoplay="{{ block.settings.autoplay }}" data-seconds="{{ block.settings.autoplay_seconds }}" data-pause="{{ block.settings.pause_hover }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
<div class="dh-bar"></div><div class="dh-overlay"></div><div class="dh-grad"></div><div class="dh-data" hidden>{% for i in (1..6) %}{% liquid
assign image_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_image'
assign location_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_location'
assign first_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_one'
assign second_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_line_two'
assign desc_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_description'
assign link_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_link'
assign label_key = 'slide_' | append: i | append: '_label'
assign slide_image = block.settings[image_key]
%}{% if block.settings[first_key] != blank %}<div class="dh-item" data-image="{% if slide_image %}{{ slide_image | image_url: width: 2400 }}{% endif %}" data-card-image="{% if slide_image %}{{ slide_image | image_url: width: 600 }}{% endif %}" data-alt="{% if slide_image %}{{ slide_image.alt | escape }}{% endif %}" data-loc="{{ block.settings[location_key] | escape }}" data-one="{{ block.settings[first_key] | escape }}" data-two="{{ block.settings[second_key] | escape }}" data-desc="{{ block.settings[desc_key] | escape }}" data-link="{{ block.settings[link_key] }}" data-label="{{ block.settings[label_key] | escape }}"></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
<div class="dh-copy"><div class="dh-dash"></div><span class="dh-location"></span><h1 class="dh-title"><span class="dh-one"></span><span class="dh-two"></span></h1><p class="dh-desc"></p><div class="dh-actions"><button class="dh-save" type="button" aria-label="Save destination" aria-pressed="false"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" height="14" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3h12v18l-6-4-6 4z" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"/></svg></button><a class="dh-link" href="#"></a></div></div><div class="dh-cards"></div><div class="dh-controls"><button class="dh-arrow dh-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><div class="dh-progress"><i></i></div><button class="dh-arrow dh-next" type="button" aria-label="Next">›</button><div class="dh-count">01</div></div>
</destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>
<script>(function(){var tag='destination-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}';if(customElements.get(tag))return;class DH extends HTMLElement{connectedCallback(){this.items=[...this.querySelectorAll('.dh-item')];this.index=0;this.render();this.querySelector('.dh-next').onclick=()=>this.go(1);this.querySelector('.dh-prev').onclick=()=>this.go(-1);this.querySelector('.dh-save').onclick=e=>{var b=e.currentTarget,s=b.getAttribute('aria-pressed')!=='true';b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',s);b.querySelector('path').setAttribute('fill',s?'currentColor':'none')};this.querySelector('.dh-cards').addEventListener('click',e=>{var card=e.target.closest('.dh-card');if(card)this.go(Number(card.dataset.index)-this.index)});this.addEventListener('mouseenter',()=>{if(this.dataset.pause==='true')this.stop()});this.addEventListener('mouseleave',()=>this.start());this.start()}go(n){this.index=(this.index+n+this.items.length)%this.items.length;this.render();this.start()}render(){var s=this.items[this.index];if(!s)return;this.querySelector('.dh-location').textContent=s.dataset.loc;this.querySelector('.dh-one').textContent=s.dataset.one;this.querySelector('.dh-two').textContent=s.dataset.two;this.querySelector('.dh-desc').textContent=s.dataset.desc;var a=this.querySelector('.dh-link');a.textContent=s.dataset.label||'Discover location';a.href=s.dataset.link||'#';var old=this.querySelector('.dh-bg,.dh-placeholder');if(s.dataset.image){var im=document.createElement('img');im.className='dh-bg';im.src=s.dataset.image;im.alt=s.dataset.alt||'';im.loading=this.index===0?'eager':'lazy';im.fetchPriority=this.index===0?'high':'auto';if(old)old.replaceWith(im);else this.insertBefore(im,this.querySelector('.dh-overlay'))}else if(!old){var ph=document.createElement('div');ph.className='dh-placeholder dh-ph';ph.innerHTML='<svg viewBox="0 0 1200 800"><rect width="1200" height="800" fill="#333"/></svg>';this.insertBefore(ph,this.querySelector('.dh-overlay'))}this.querySelector('.dh-count').textContent=String(this.index+1).padStart(2,'0');this.querySelector('.dh-progress i').style.width=(this.index/this.items.length*100)+'%';var c=this.querySelector('.dh-cards');c.innerHTML='';for(var x=1;x<this.items.length;x++){var idx=(this.index+x)%this.items.length,item=this.items[idx],b=document.createElement('button');b.className='dh-card';b.type='button';b.dataset.index=idx;if(item.dataset.cardImage){var pic=document.createElement('img');pic.src=item.dataset.cardImage;pic.srcset=item.dataset.cardImage+' 600w';pic.alt='';pic.loading='lazy';b.appendChild(pic)}else{var ph=document.createElement('span');ph.className='dh-ph';ph.innerHTML='<svg viewBox="0 0 400 600"><rect width="400" height="600" fill="#333"/></svg>';b.appendChild(ph)}var cp=document.createElement('span');cp.className='dh-cardcopy';cp.innerHTML='<small></small><strong></strong>';cp.querySelector('small').textContent=item.dataset.loc;cp.querySelector('strong').textContent=(item.dataset.one+' '+item.dataset.two).trim();b.appendChild(cp);c.appendChild(b)}}start(){this.stop();if(this.dataset.autoplay==='true'&&this.items.length>1)this.timer=setInterval(()=>this.go(1),Number(this.dataset.seconds)*1000)}stop(){clearInterval(this.timer)}}customElements.define(tag,DH)})();</script>
